# The base/overlay Dockerfiles COPY nothing, so the build context is only validated, not read.
# Still, docker/images.py passes the whole repo root as context — keep the tarball the daemon
# receives tiny (the venv alone is ~18M) so an auto-build from the TUI stays snappy.
.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
